  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the common tangent to the parabolas <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>y</mi></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Any tangent to <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> in slope form is<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> which is also tangent to <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>y</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> will have equal roots.<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Discriminant of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is zero<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;Equation of the common tangent is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
}